OL,3,GNEWSA'An absolute one-off' - former BBC
OL,4,Abroadcaster Conor Bradford dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer BBC News NI radio and TV
OL,7,Fpresenter Conor Bradford has died aged
OL,8,F73.
OL,10,FThe veteran broadcaster presented
OL,11,FInside Ulster, Good Morning Ulster and
OL,12,FEvening Extra during a four-decade
OL,13,Fcareer on the airwaves, before retiring
OL,14,Fin 2022.
OL,16,FAdam Smyth, director of BBC Northern
OL,17,FIreland, said Bradford was an "absolute
OL,18,Fone-off".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
