OL,3,GNEWSA'An absolute one-off' - former BBC
OL,4,Abroadcaster Conor Bradford dies
OL,5,
OL,6,F"His on-air and off-air personas were
OL,7,Fexactly the same; flamboyant, witty,
OL,8,Fwarm and curious - he was a pleasure to
OL,9,Fproduce," he said.
